height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div></div><div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\"><div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DP_UfsTksuz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by Ningbo Open (@wtaningboopen)</a></p></div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p><strong>Remaining direct entrants: </strong>Sorana Cirstea, Alexandra Eala, Maja Chwalinska, Ekaterina Alexandrova, Marie Bouzkova, Sara Bejlek, Jasmine Paolini</p>\n<p><strong>Wild cards: </strong>To be determined</p>\n<p><strong>Withdrawals: </strong>Anna Kalinskaya (illness), Jessica Pegula </p>\n<p><strong>Moved into main draw: </strong>Diane Parry, Leylah Fernandez</p>\n<p><em>Player list is subject to change</em></p>\n<p><strong>Draw:</strong> The main draw will be determined at 7 p.m. local time on Saturday, October 17. </p>\n<h4>Who are the defending champions?</h4>\n<p>Rybakina won her 10th career singles title in Ningbo last season, defeating Alexandrova 3-6, 6-0, 6-2.</p>\n<p>At the time, she entered the tournament ranked No. 9, but her run in Ningbo was the foundation for her 2025 WTA Finals Riyadh title and a 2026 season that saw her win two more Grand Slam titles and take the No. 1 ranking. </p>\n<p>In addition to Alexandrova, she also defeated Dayana Yastremska, Ajla Tomljanovic and Jasmine Paolini, the initial four wins of a 11-match winning streak to end her 2025 season. </p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n\n\n</div><p>In doubles, Nicole Melichar-Martinez and Liudmila Samsonova defeated Timea Babos and Luisa Stefani 5-7, 6-4, [10-8]. </p>\n<h4>What are the prize money and ranking points at stake?</h4>\n<p>The tournament will have a collective prize pool of approximately $1,206,446. As with all WTA 500 events, a maximum of 500 ranking points are available depending on how far a player or team advances in the tournament.</p>\n<p>Here's a full breakdown of the prize money, in USD, and ranking points available in the draws.</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Singles</span></strong><br /><em>First round:</em> 1 | $12,700<br /><em>Second round:</em> 60 | $17,795<br /><em>Quarterfinal: </em>108 | $33,475<br /><em>Semifinal: </em>195 | $66,003<br /><em>Finalist:</em> 325 | $114,500<br /><em>Champion: </em>500 | $185,500</p>\n<p>Qualifying for main draw earns 25 ranking points.</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Doubles</span></strong><br /><em>First round:</em> 1 | $6,800<br /><em>Quarterfinal:</em> 108 | $11,150<br /><em>Semifinal:</em> 195 | $21,720<br /><em>Finalist:</em> 325 | $37,400<br /><em>Champion:</em> 500 | $61,540</p>","author":"Cole Bambini","subtitle":null,"summary":"The BNB Ningbo Open serves as the second-to-last WTA 500 event of the season, and is currently headlined by Elena Rybakina, Elina Svitolina, Iga Swiatek and more. Here is everything you need to know.","hotlinkUrl":null,"duration":147,"contentSummary":null,"leadMedia":{"id":4593063,"accountId":29,"type":"photo","title":"Elena Rybakina, Ningbo","description":null,"date":"2026-10-16T03:37:00Z","location":null,"coordinates":[0.0,0.0],"commentsOn":false,"copyright":null,"publishFrom":1792121858069,"publishTo":0,"tags":[],"platform":"PULSE_CMS","language":"en","additionalInfo":{},"canonicalUrl":"","references":[],"related":[],"metadata":{"credit":"Photo by CN-STR/AFP via Getty Images"},"titleTranslations":null,"lastModified":1792121903311,"titleUrlSegment":"gettyimages-2241695003","visibilityOrder":[],"allowedUserGroups":[],"allowedTerritories":[],"subtitle":null,"onDemandUrl":"https://photoresources.wtatennis.com/photo-resources/2026/10/16/01fb8421-0531-4365-9533-9c27fe9fa94c/GettyImages-2241695003.jpg","originalDetails":{"width":5110,"height":3406,"aspectRatio":1.5002936},"imageUrl":"https://photoresources.wtatennis.com/wta/photo/2026/10/16/b6f7ca93-12d7-4bcd-a6d7-c5c7009acbdc/GettyImages-2241695003.jpg"},"imageUrl":"https://photoresources.wtatennis.com/wta/photo/2026/10/16/b6f7ca93-12d7-4bcd-a6d7-c5c7009acbdc/GettyImages-2241695003.jpg","onDemandUrl":"https://photoresources.wtatennis.com/photo-resources/2026/10/16/01fb8421-0531-4365-9533-9c27fe9fa94c/GettyImages-2241695003.jpg"}